n\n\n$$\n{e}^{x}{y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x=2\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)={e}^{x},b(x)=4,c(x)=0,$ and $f(x)=2+x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-2x{y}^{′}+5y=x\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=1,b(x)=-2x,c(x)=5,$ and $f(x)=x.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${e}^{x}{y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x=2$; ${y}^{″}-2x{y}^{′}+5y=x$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265956 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5376bc4a-d2ee-53b0-8e83-f4f85ee671db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463892} {:answer/id #uuid "e836b290-1712-593e-90f1-85ca64c5b2f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463893}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5376bc4a-d2ee-53b0-8e83-f4f85ee671db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463892} :answer-field/id #uuid "e61661a3-fd91-5136-a7ad-2a91a6b84524" :answer-field/key "$2{x}^{2}{y}^{″}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,{y}^{′}+{y}^{2}=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464880} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dcf03b04-4823-5f32-bafa-b26f7eff5b14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463894} {:answer/id #uuid "f58e7ac7-373e-5c44-b04b-79bdda1f1397" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463895}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f58e7ac7-373e-5c44-b04b-79bdda1f1397" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463895} :answer-field/id #uuid "734e4fb0-c9f7-5eb8-a761-e27666d89c5a" :